  "program": {
    "module": {
      "summary": "Flat-tax example RuleSpec module.\n\nEach person has a personal allowance deducted from gross income to produce\ntaxable income. A flat rate applies, with a higher rate when gross income\nreaches the high-income threshold. Tax is rounded up with ceil().\n\nSynthetic RuleSpec module — not modelled on any specific statute."
    },
